the problem 

One "fat" interface forces every implementing class to implement methods it doesn't need
Symptoms: empty bodies, throw UnsupportedOperationException, NotImplementedError
Example: Worker { work(), eat(), sleep() } → RobotWorker forced to implement eat() and sleep()

